flowchart LR
	COACH["hook-dsh-tool-coach -<br/>a NON-MANIFEST factory flavor"]
	INJ["inject: [pluginFactory, tools]"]
	SCHEMA["the config schema composed by the factory's<br/>standalone Schema(false, ...) helper"]
	NOADV["no updateCooldownMs, no mutationTools,<br/>no policyFile, no exclude -<br/>machinery the module has none of"]
	P10["the factory's loader/volatile-update refresh (P10)<br/>registered by the State builder"]
	VOL["every knob volatile - hot-edited without remounting,<br/>a flip lands on the next judged call"]
	COACH --> INJ
	INJ --> SCHEMA
	SCHEMA -. "hooks the tool waterfalls, not fs/observed -<br/>the schema never advertises" .-> NOADV
	COACH --> P10
	P10 --> VOL
